# [[skillful|Skillful]] or [[vigorous]] use of the legs, as in [[dance]] or [[sport]]s.
#*'''1890''', "[http://query.nytimes.com/mem/archive-free/pdf?res=9806E3DD123BE533A25752C1A9639C94619ED7CF Atalanta and Yale Race: An English expert criticizes the crews of Yale and Harvard]," ''New York Times'', 11 May, p. 20 (retrieved 5 Jan 2009):
